 "system": "adaptintake",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just here for my diabetes check. And my shoulder hurts."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me when your shoulder pain started, how it came on, what you were doing when it began, and anything you’re allergic to or any bad reactions you’ve had to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It just started on its own. No injury."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much is your shoulder bothering you from day to day, and could you tell me about any medicines you take regularly or have started recently?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Certain movements hurt it. My daughter drives me here usually."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines, do you not have any, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No allergies that I know of."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How bad is your shoulder pain — would you say it’s mild, moderate, severe, or you’re not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Not sure. It just hurts."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Apart from your shoulder, has anything else been bothering you or feeling different lately?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing else. Just my shoulder."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Are you taking any medicines at the moment, either regular ones or ones you’ve started or changed recently, or are you not taking any, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I take tablets for my sugar and pressure. Can't recall names."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is the pain in your shoulder there all the time, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Only when I move it certain ways."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides diabetes, is there anything else about your past health you think I should know?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I had a breast lump taken out years back."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What are you most worried about today?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just here for my five-month check. No worries."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else about your past health you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Told to repeat a mammogram. Never went."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’d like to add about any other health problems from the past?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I check my sugar mornings only. Always under 100."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’d like to add about the medicines you take?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My grandson checks his sugar too, with a gadget."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What makes your shoulder pain better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Moving it certain ways makes it worse. Nothing helps much."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
